A DLL mod that lets you summon more spirits from every Spirit Ash, giving you a whole army to conquer the Lands Between - increase them by a multiplier or set a fixed number, all in the config file.

[size=4][b][color=#C0860A]F[/color][color=#CF9F31]e[/color][color=#DFB858]a[/color][color=#EED17F]t[/color][color=#EED17F]u[/color][color=#DFB858]r[/color][color=#CF9F31]e[/color][color=#C0860A]s[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Summon more spirits per Ash: a multiplier (default x2) or a fixed number.[/*]
[*]Works with every Spirit Ash, including ones added by other mods.[/*]
[*]Summon several different Spirit Ashes at once, or extra copies of the same one.[/*]
[*]Re-summon spirits without resting at a Site of Grace.[/*]
[*]Summon spirits outside summoning pool areas.[/*]
[*]Spirits regenerate HP over time, with options for a fixed amount, a percent of max HP or a percent of missing HP.[/*]
[*]Improved spirit combat behavior, such as seeing farther and working together better.[/*]
[*]Improved spirit movement: they follow you better and teleport to you more often.[/*]
[*]Removes the ghost color from spirits so they look like normal characters.[/*]
[*]Works in [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/510]Seamless Co-op[/url]: each player gets their own spirits, as long as everyone has the mod installed.[/*]
[*]Hotkey to reload the ini without restarting the game.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#C0860A]N[/color][color=#DBB24E]o[/color][color=#F6DE92]t[/color][color=#DBB24E]e[/color][color=#C0860A]s[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Summon up to 60 spirits at once within the safe limit - or push it further, like 1000, if your PC can handle it :)[/*]
[*]Re-summoning spirits without resting doesn't work with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/541]ER Reforged[/url], since it has its own summoning system.[/*]
[*]In [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/541]ER Reforged[/url], [color=#ff0000]Spirit Fury[/color] only works on one Spirit Ash at a time - it can't be activated on several summoned Ashes at once.[/*]
[/list]

